# Conformance probe pack for gate blocks (spec 0.17, Encode step 2): a raw key
# with a `default` on the gate bit. Fixed `bits` layout, least significant
# bit first. Public. No kinds. One byte per word. Exercises: the bits of a
# default are not written in step 2, so the gate value of an open block
# replaces them; a present raw key is written, and a value that does not
# hold the block leaves its key without a line (`transform-encode`).
#
#   byte 0       bit 0: val is valid, also the raw key c2 (default 0)
#   byte 1       val
format     conformance-gates-default
version    0.17.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
field   probe.c2   0:0:1   uint
default probe.c2   0
if      0:0:1  1
  field probe.val  0:8:8   uint
end
